 Independent corroboration from the constructors' data in the same commit: their codeword lists
 `words_QD_CAMEL[[257,121]]_H_X.CW` and `words_QD_CAMEL[[257,121]]_H_Z.CW` contain no codeword of
 ker H_X or ker H_Z below weight 10. They list 3,205 and 3,186 words of weight 10, and every listed
-weight-10 word is a nontrivial logical (outside the row space of the other check matrix). For a CSS
-code d_X >= d(ker H_X), so the constructors' estimate is d = 10 if that enumeration is complete
-below weight 10. That is not certified here.
+weight-10 word is a nontrivial logical (outside the row space of the other check matrix). Every
